  (text "SAO++ edition of davedarko's Do Or Donut: 144 LEDs\nand IS31FL3731 are his circuit, unchanged (matrix.json).\nDriver on a private I2C bus: D10 SDA, D3 SCL, 0x74." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7f039856-683a-5cdd-9c26-240d53d57df0"))
  (text "SW1: SAO = badge feeds the 3.3 V rail. OFF = XIAO D1\nhigh, firmware sleeps. USB-BAT = XIAO feeds the rail.\nNever USB and SAO at once. To confirm against the\ndatasheet: R6, C1, C3-C5." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 220.98 54.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b65bf545-55f0-5452-ab73-88e6cecfd09e"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
